  "title": "Baked Chicken Schnitzel",
  "description": "Chicken schnitzel is easy to make in the oven. Baking breaded chicken breasts makes them golden and crispy on the outside, while tender and juicy inside.",
  "authors": [
    "Chef V"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T03:05:08-04:00",
